{"id":"dernie_rement","lemma":"dernièrement","pos":"adv","rank":2496,"glosses":["lately, of late (in the recent past)","lastly (in last place)"],"ipa":"/dɛʁ.njɛʁ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/94/Fr-derni%C3%A8rement.ogg/Fr-derni%C3%A8rement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"As-tu lu quelques bons livres dernièrement ?","en":"Have you read any good books lately?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to read","l":"lire"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"book","l":"livre"},null]},{"text":"À ce propos, l'as-tu vu dernièrement ?","en":"By the way, have you seen him lately?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/27210","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"about that"]]},{"text":"J'ai perdu du poids, dernièrement.","en":"I've lost weight recently.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"weight"},null]},{"text":"J'ai pris beaucoup de poids dernièrement.","en":"I've gained a lot of weight recently.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"weighty"]]},{"text":"Je ne l'ai pas vu dernièrement.","en":"I haven't seen him lately.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},null]}]}